title: Jira in a pane
flow: The Jira integration as a tab: issues grouped by status, a row's detail, the second tab, and a filter — here against an offline fake server.
# From tools/site-record/flows/jira.flow, without the recorder's
# `record` / `poster` marks; `reset` clears what the flow before left.
reset
# The recorder installed Jira from the INTEGRATIONS list here; the demo
# has it installed already.
run integrations.open_as_tab
reset
open src/main.zig
until "fn main"
wait 100
run jira_work.open
until "JIRA WORK" 15000
heal "fetch failed" r "JIRA WORK (3)"
wait 600
keys @300 down down down
key d
wait 700
key esc
wait 500
key 2
wait 1100
key 1
wait 700
key /
wait 250
slowtype "card" 90
wait 1000
key esc
wait 700
